Check_actEIRP_Flags_In_L2_PS_Cell_Reconf_Req
    [Documentation]                 Check in a pcap file that in itf_l2_ps_cell_cellreconfigurationreq the Eirp Elements are
    ...                             upgraded
    [Arguments]                     ${pcapFile}
    Dated Log new line              Convert pcap to pdml
    ${pdmlFile}=                    analyzer.pcap_to_pdml       ${pcapFile}
    ${actEirpControl}               set variable                itf_l2_ps_cell_CellReconfigurationReq.actEirpControl.actEirpControl-Items
    ${prefix}                       set variable                powerReductionFactor
    ${powerReduction}               set variable                itf_l2_ps_cell_CellReconfigurationReq.values.values-Items
    #Check that actEirpControl is 0x00 (Eirp deactivated)
    Dated Log                       Search in l2_ps_cell_CellReconfigurationReq: ${actEirpControl} MATCH 01
    analyzer.check_list             pdmlFile=${pdmlFile}
    ...                             packetName=itf_l2_ps_cell_CellReconfigurationReq
    ...                             path=${actEirpControl}$
    ...                             value=00
    ...                             kind=value
    ...                             test=MATCH


Check_PRF_Flags_In_L2_PS_Cell_Reconf_Req
